[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0010","text":"冬优子！　爱依！\n来玩枕头大战！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0020","text":"……我奉陪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0030","text":"你那什么表情"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0040","text":"啊哈哈～……\n我还以为冬优子会拒绝呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0050","text":"你们俩啊，反正肯定会自己闹起来的\n……我就陪你们玩玩"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0060","text":"……然后就会这样瞄准过来对吧？\n这种程度，冬优早就看穿了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0070","text":"噢～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0080","text":"所以呢……\n接招！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0090","text":"哇……！\n你居然……那我也！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_03_0100","text":"……！\n不是说好让我先来的吗～！"}]
